    4. Pick diagonal direction: TL->BR or TR->BL.
    5. Place N copies of the sprite at (2k, col_k) for k=0..N-1,
       where col_k = 2k (TL->BR) or W-2-2k (TR->BL).
    6. Fill remaining cells with 0.
